  "description": "Raised to obey, not inherit, Ava “the Screwup” Moretti struggles to claim her place as the youngest child of one of New York’s most powerful mob families. But one steamy night with a stranger gives her a taste of freedom she was never meant to have. When she learns that her one-night stand is Nick Caponelli, heir to her family’s rival, desire threatens to shake the delicate balance between two powerful mobs. Based on the hit Wattpad story with over 6.6M reads. This series contains mature themes that may not be suitable for some viewers. Viewer discretion is advised.\n(Source: Webtoon)",
